cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use colmap4d, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "colmap4d: a timestamped extension of the COLMAP sparse model for 4D data"
abstract: >-
  colmap4d extends a standard COLMAP sparse model with per-image and per-point
  timestamps, modeling each image and point as an independent spacetime sample
  (x, y, z, t), with strict backward compatibility.
authors:
  - name: "colmap4d authors"
version: 1.0.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kiri-Innovation/colmap4d"
keywords:
  - COLMAP
  - structure-from-motion
  - 4D reconstruction
  - dynamic scenes
  - Gaussian splatting
